# Chapter 1 — the stall, the letter, the crew.
@id ch1_inheritance
@title Inheritance
@trigger start
@order 10

== start
narrator: Dusk. One by one, the lanterns of Gloamhollow wake up.
narrator: Your new stall is small, smells of old smoke and onions, and has exactly three wobbly stools.
odessa (happy): Dear one — if you're reading this, the stall is yours now.
odessa (neutral): The roof leaks. The stools wobble. And Maro will pretend he doesn't need you.
odessa (sad): He does. Feed the street, pay your people, and listen to the Hollow when it breathes.
odessa (happy): — O.  P.S. Don't let Maro skip lunch.
maro (neutral): …
maro (angry): I don't skip lunch.
maro (neutral): Hm. So you're the one she picked.
* "I'd like to learn from you, Maro."
  ~ affinity maro +1
  -> learn
* "I'm the owner now. Let's open up."
  ~ flag bold_start
  -> bold
* "Where did Odessa go?"
  ~ flag asked_odessa
  -> where

== learn
maro (surprised): …Learn.
maro (happy): Taste first. Talk later. That's the whole lesson.
-> pip

== bold
maro (neutral): Hm. She said the same thing, her first night. Then she burned the rice.
maro (happy): Here. Her emergency jar. Don't burn the rice.
~ gold +30
-> pip

== where
maro (sad): Away. Looking for something she lost a long time ago.
maro (neutral): She'll write. She always writes.
-> pip

== pip
pip (surprised): Is this them?! Is this the new boss?!
pip (happy): Hi! I'm Pip! I dive the Hollow, I bring back mushrooms, and one day I'm going to be a LEGEND.
maro (neutral): You're going to be late.
pip (happy): Right! Floor One! Back before the soup!
* "Be careful down there."
  ~ affinity pip +1
  pip (happy): Careful's my middle name! …It isn't. It's Wren. Bye!
* "Bring back lots of mushrooms!"
  pip (happy): ALL the mushrooms! Bye!
narrator: The door bangs. Somewhere below, the Hollow breathes out — warm, and a little sweet.
-> end
